Better syntax for these models are now possible on the dev version. So your model syntax should use something like this:

model_constrained_within_country <- mirt.model('F1=1-7
                                 F2=8-14
                                 CONSTRAIN = (1,8,a1,a2), (2,9,a1,a2),(3,10,a1,a2),(4,11,a1,a2),(5,12,a1,a2),(6,13,a1,a2),(7,14,a1,a2)
                                 COV=F1*F2')

Cheers.

Phil

