Hi Phil,

when i fit a mixedmirt model i have problems obtaining the iteminformation:

mod <- mixedmirt(Science, covdat, model=1, fixed = ~ 0 + group) #example from documentation
Theta = matrix(seq(-4,4,.1))
iteminfo(extract.item(mod, 1), Theta = Theta)

I get an error

  Theta does not have the correct number of dimensions

but reading from source code, this statement should be FALSE and the function should run:

if(ncol(Theta) != x@nfact)

stop('Theta does not have the correct number of dimensions')

> mod@nfact
[1] 1
> ncol(Theta)
[1] 1
Best wishes! Felix

